Usage: cardano-testnet status [--testnet-dir FILEPATH]
  [--timeout SECONDS]
  [--json]
  

  Check the status of a running testnet

Available options:
  --testnet-dir FILEPATH   Path to the environment folder of the testnet whose
                           status to check, by default "./testnet".
  --timeout SECONDS        How many seconds to wait for each node to answer (1 -
                           3600). (default: 5)
  --json                   Output status as JSON instead of a table.
  -h,--help                Show this help text
